# Bring your story to life | Music & SFX for videos | Epidemic Sound
> Epidemic Sound provides a catalog of 55,000+ tracks and 250,000+ sound effects, licensed for worry-free use in video content on YouTube, social media, podcasts, film, and commercial projects. All plans include global rights clearance with no per-use fees.

